  photo: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1e9289a47760b4d4b98c61d7421a9942, type: 3}
  title: "Siouxsie & The Banshees \u2013 Tour 80, Berlin"
  description: Concert poster for Siouxsie and the Banshees' Tour 80, Berlin 3 October
    1980 at Neue Welt, with special guest Mania D. Notably, Zensor is listed as one
    of the official ticket outlets (Vorverkauf).
  hasExtraInfo: 1
  extraInfoTitle: Siouxsie and the Banshees
  extraInfoContent: "Siouxsie and the Banshees were one of the most influential\npost-punk
    bands to emerge from the UK in the late 1970s.\nTheir 3 October 1980 Berlin concert
    at the Neue Welt was\npart of a major European tour. The support act Mania D.
    were\na key Berlin band of the Neue Deutsche Welle scene.\nThe fact that Zensor
    was listed as a ticket outlet reflects\nthe shop's central role in West Berlin's
    music network \u2014\na trusted hub connecting local audiences with international\nunderground
    acts."
  extraInfoImage: {fileID: 0}
